# Known vulnerabilities accepted on purpose. Used by Trivy (image scan) and, by the CI audit job,
# by pip-audit. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:), after which CI fails again.
#
# Pillow 12.x (fixed in 13.0.0): only in the UI image, pulled in by Streamlit, and every Streamlit
# release so far (1.66.0) requires pillow<13. The UI never decodes an image (uploads are passed to
# the API as raw bytes, and the API image has no Pillow), so the vulnerable code is not reachable.
# Remove these once Streamlit allows pillow 13 and the lock is regenerated (scripts/lock.sh --upgrade).
CVE-2026-112395 exp:2027-01-31
CVE-2026-112397 exp:2027-01-31
CVE-2026-112400 exp:2027-01-31
